  "answer": "Some people need to use a dialysis machine because their kidneys are damaged or not functioning properly. The kidneys play a vital role in filtering waste products and excess fluids from the blood. When the kidneys are damaged, they cannot perform this function effectively, leading to the accumulation of poisonous wastes in the body, which can be life-threatening. Dialysis is a medical treatment that helps replace the function of the kidneys by filtering the blood.",
